{
  "slug": "dry",
  "name": "Dry",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Analyzes session interactions and recommends repeatable patterns for automation via skills, hooks, sub-agents, or slash commands",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent**, **1 command** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `analyze` (Use when you want to identify repeatable patterns in your current Claude Code session that could be automated…)\n- **Agents** (1): `pattern-scaffolder` (Use this agent to generate correctly structured Claude Code plugin files (skills, hooks, sub-agents, or slash commands) from…)\n- **Commands** (1): `analyze` (Analyze session for repeatable patterns that can be automated as skills, hooks, sub-agents, or slash commands)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dry@claude-community` from `FahadMustafa/dry-claude-plugin`.",
